sequenceDiagram
    participant CI as CI/CD Pipeline
    participant Extractor as model-extractor<br/>Go CLI
    participant HF as HuggingFace API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant GH as GitHub API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant OCI as OCI Registries<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant FS as data/ Directory
    participant Report as metadata-report<br/>Go CLI
    participant Image as Container Image<br/>UBI9-micro
    participant Consumer as RHOAI Component<br/>(e.g. Dashboard)

    Note over CI,OCI: Flow 1: CI/CD Metadata Collection Pipeline

    CI->>Extractor: Execute model-extractor

    par Parallel metadata collection
        Extractor->>HF: GET /api/collections<br/>Auth: Bearer HF_TOKEN (optional)
        HF-->>Extractor: Model collection metadata

        Extractor->>GH: GET /repos/.../contents<br/>Auth: Bearer GITHUB_TOKEN (optional)
        GH-->>Extractor: Agent metadata + READMEs

        Extractor->>OCI: Query manifests<br/>Auth: containers/image default chain
        OCI-->>Extractor: Image architecture + timestamps
    end

    Extractor->>Extractor: Merge with static<br/>supplemental catalogs
    Extractor->>FS: Write YAML catalog files<br/>(models, MCP servers, agents)

    CI->>Report: Execute metadata-report
    Report->>FS: Read catalog files
    Report-->>CI: Completeness report

    Note over Image,Consumer: Flow 2: Container Volume Mount (Runtime)

    CI->>Image: Build container<br/>COPY data/ → /app/data/
    Image->>Image: CMD sleep infinity<br/>(no application logic)

    Consumer->>Image: Mount volume /app/data/
    Image-->>Consumer: YAML catalog files<br/>(filesystem read, no network)
